---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Post.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy - WhatsApp Bot";
const description =
  "Privacy policy for Antonio Gioia's personal WhatsApp bot using WhatsApp Business Platform / Cloud API.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>{title}</h1>

  <p>Last updated: June 12, 2026</p>

  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how the personal bot/agent managed by Antonio
    Gioia processes data when interacting with users through WhatsApp.
  </p>

  <p>
    The bot uses WhatsApp Business Platform / Cloud API to receive and send
    WhatsApp messages. When you contact the bot, the following data may be
    processed:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>your WhatsApp phone number;</li>
    <li>your WhatsApp name or profile information, if available;</li>
    <li>the content of messages sent and received;</li>
    <li>the date and time of messages;</li>
    <li>the state of the conversation;</li>
    <li>technical metadata needed to operate the service.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>This data is processed to:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>receive messages;</li>
    <li>generate automatic replies;</li>
    <li>maintain conversation history;</li>
    <li>monitor the correct operation of the bot;</li>
    <li>allow manual intervention when needed.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Data may transit through Meta / WhatsApp Business Platform and through the
    technical systems used to operate the bot. Data is not sold and is not used
    to send spam.
  </p>

  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data by
    contacting <a href="mailto:info@antoniogioia.com">info@antoniogioia.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Data deletion</h2>

  <p>
    To request deletion of data associated with your WhatsApp conversations with
    the bot, please follow the
    <a href="/whatsapp-bot/data-deletion">Data Deletion Instructions</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
